WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:06,040
Zuhou

2
00:00:06,040 --> 00:00:07,840
He wants to overturn the capital by enriching himself

3
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:21,260
Cover me and put me in the water to kill fish

4
00:00:21,260 --> 00:00:30,170
what do you mean

5
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:33,550
What about your sister?

6
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:35,850
My sister was killed by a fish and dragged into the sea and eaten.

7
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:40,660
What the hell is going on

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,820
How could Shen Ning be eaten by a fish?

9
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:55,570
My poor daughter

10
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:58,110
Not long after we were found in the Shen family

11
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,950
Not like this

12
00:01:01,150 --> 00:01:02,150
Have you found rescue?

13
00:01:02,350 --> 00:01:03,750
What if your son is still alive?

14
00:01:03,750 --> 00:01:42,740
We can't stop her

15
00:01:42,740 --> 00:01:57,780
stay on top now

16
00:01:57,980 --> 00:01:59,700
All we have to do is fight to the death
